<title>USA: Viad stake held by Franklin.</title>
<headline>Viad stake held by Franklin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Franklin Resources Inc said Thursday it holds a 9.2 percent stake in Viad Corp or 8,784,600 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 334,100 common shares between February 21 and March 12 at prices ranging from $16 to $17.1293 per share.</p>
<p>Viad, based in Phoenix, Az., specializes in convention and trade show services, payment services, airline services and travel and leisure.</p>
